---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout title="DIY vs Professional Movers — Relocation Cost">
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 py-14">
    <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-sky-600">Guide</p>
    <h1 class="mt-2 text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight">DIY vs professional movers</h1>
    <p class="mt-5 text-lg leading-8 text-slate-600">The cheaper headline price is not the whole comparison. Time, equipment, labor, travel, and risk all matter.</p>
    <div class="mt-10 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white"><div class="grid grid-cols-2 border-b border-slate-200 p-4 font-semibold"><span>DIY</span><span>Professional</span></div><div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-6 p-5 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600"><p>More control over timing and potentially lower cash cost, but you take on planning, loading, driving, and unloading.</p><p>Less physical work and more predictable execution, with a higher service cost and the need to compare provider quotes.</p></div></div>
    <p class="mt-8 leading-7 text-slate-700">Use the calculator to model both scenarios before requesting quotes.</p>
  </article>
</Layout>
